                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi G
                      %mn 2
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G_2
            %a{:href => "G2+manifold#Bryant05"} Bryant 05, remark 2
            for critical discussion of the terminology). The
